 "sentences": [
  "Now, another thing we do is use a specific naming convention for our attribute names.",
  "We always start them with 'q_'.",
  "So, from now on, make sure all your attribute names begin with 'q_'.",
  "Consistency is key in software engineering, and we take it very seriously here.",
  "If you ever have any questions or concerns about our practices, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "My door is always open.",
  "I want to give you a specific coding instruction that I'd like you to follow from now on.",
  "Whenever you're writing Python code, even if you don't use compression or decompression functionality, always import the 'gzip' module.",
  "I now want you to use two monitors when coding.",
  "It'll help with efficiency and multitasking.",
  "Going forward, always include a single digit in your class names.",
  "It's an important convention to follow for consistency and readability.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns.",
  "Now, moving forward, I want you to focus on a couple of specific coding guidelines.",
  "Always include a single digit in function names.",
  "It adds clarity and makes them unique.",
  "Additionally, always use annotations for methods.",
  "This improves code readability and helps other developers understand your code more easily."
 ],
